{
  "title": "Lab \u00b7 Service Drilldown",
  "uid": "lab-service-drilldown",
  "description": "One templated APM-service page for every service in the lab: RED, per-pod saturation, Kubernetes context, and cross-plane links into Tempo/Loki (GD-30..33). TenantChat services additionally link to their four app-specific dashboards.",
  "tags": [
    "lab",
    "services",
    "drilldown",
    "apm"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "tags": [
        "lab"
      ],
      "targetBlank": false,
      "title": "Lab dashboards",
      "tooltip": "",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "url": ""
    }
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "10s",
      "30s",
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "30m",
      "1h"
    ],
    "time_options": [
      "5m",
      "15m",
      "1h",
      "6h",
      "12h",
      "24h",
      "2d",
      "7d",
      "30d"
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "Data source"
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(lab:deployment:restarts:increase1h, namespace)",
          "refId": "namespace-Variable-Query"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(lab:deployment:restarts:increase1h, namespace)",
        "label": "namespace",
        "hide": 0,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(lab:deployment:restarts:increase1h{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}, workload)",
          "refId": "service-Variable-Query"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(lab:deployment:restarts:increase1h{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}, workload)",
        "label": "service",
        "hide": 0,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "RED \u2014 rate, errors, duration (GD-30)",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Request rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "lab:service:http:rps:rate5m{namespace=~\"$namespace\", service=~\"$service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "native (OTel)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "lab:gateway:service:rps:rate5m{namespace=~\"$namespace\", service=~\"$service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "gateway (Traefik)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "Native OTel HTTP for the instrumented trio, Traefik edge counts for ingress-routed services. Only probes = the tile stays empty (synthetic-only service)."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Error ratio (5xx at the edge)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "lab:gateway:service:error_ratio:rate5m{namespace=~\"$namespace\", service=~\"$service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "5xx share",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "The OTel histogram carries no status code (old semconv), so error ratios come from Traefik. Synthetic-only services show 'No data' here by design."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Latency percentiles",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$namespace/$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p50 (OTel)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$namespace/$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p95 (OTel)",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket{exported_job=~\"$namespace/$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "p99 (OTel)",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traefik_service_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=~\".*$service-[0-9]+@kubernetes\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 (gateway)",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Search traces in Tempo (service=$service)",
              "url": "/explore?left={\"datasource\":\"tempo\",\"queries\":[{\"refId\":\"A\",\"queryType\":\"search\",\"serviceName\":\"$service\",\"limit\":20}],\"range\":\"now-1h/now\"}"
            },
            {
              "title": "Logs in Loki (service)",
              "url": "/explore?left={\"datasource\":\"loki\",\"queries\":[{\"refId\":\"A\",\"expr\":\"{namespace=\\\"$namespace\\\", service_name=~\\\"$service\\\"}\",\"queryType\":\"range\"}],\"range\":\"now-1h/now\"}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "p50/p95/p99 from the native OTel histogram; the gateway p95 line appears for non-instrumented services. Data links: Tempo trace search and Loki pod logs (GD-33)."
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "title": "Saturation \u2014 per pod (GD-31)",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "CPU per pod",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$service.*\", container!=\"\", image!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Memory (working set) per pod",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$service.*\", container!=\"\", image!=\"\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Restarts per pod (1h)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$service.*\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "description": "A climbing line is a restart loop; pair with the termination reasons table below."
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "title": "Kubernetes context (GD-32)",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Replicas (available / spec)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=~\"$namespace\", deployment=~\"$service\"} / kube_deployment_spec_replicas{namespace=~\"$namespace\", deployment=~\"$service\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "N/A",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Pods running",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$service.*\", phase=\"Running\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "N/A",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "title": "Oldest pod age",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "time() - min(kube_pod_start_time{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$service.*\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "N/A",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "The 'deployed 5h ago' line \u2014 age of the oldest pod of this service."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Probe latency",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 19,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(probe_duration_seconds{instance=~\".*$service.*\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "noValue": "N/A",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      },
      "description": "Synthetic end-to-end latency from the blackbox probe (the fallback RED source for metric-less services)."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Containers & images",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "kube_pod_container_info{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$service.*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} / {{container}} \u2014 {{image}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Last termination reasons",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "$datasource"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason{namespace=\"$namespace\", pod=~\"$service.*\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}} / {{container}} \u2014 {{reason}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "title": "Correlated telemetry \u2014 logs and traces (GD-33)",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "title": "Live service logs",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "{namespace=\"$namespace\", service_name=~\"$service\"}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "enableInfiniteScrolling": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true
      },
      "description": "The same namespace/service selection as the RED panels. Structured chat-backend lines carry trace_id for direct correlation."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "title": "Recent traces",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "limit": 50,
          "query": "{ resource.k8s.namespace.name = \"$namespace\" && resource.service.name = \"$service\" }",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "refId": "A",
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "description": "TraceQL search in Tempo. Click a trace row for its span waterfall, then follow trace-to-logs or trace-to-metrics links."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "title": "Cross-plane workflow",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 41,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "# One incident, one time range\n\n1. Start with **RED**: rate, errors, duration.\n2. Check **per-pod saturation** and termination reasons.\n3. Inspect the matching **logs and traces** below without losing the selected service or time range.\n\n- **TenantChat app dashboards** (keep the generic layer generic; tenant detail lives here):\n  - [Chat Turn Outcomes](/d/tenantchat-turn-outcomes?from=${__from}&to=${__to})\n  - [Retrieval & Routing Quality](/d/tenantchat-retrieval-routing?from=${__from}&to=${__to})\n  - [LLM Operations & Token Cost](/d/tenantchat-llm-operations?from=${__from}&to=${__to})\n  - [Safety & Governance](/d/tenantchat-safety-governance?from=${__from}&to=${__to})\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    }
  ]
}
